  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "Bonjour. Je m’appelle Trian.\nJe suis créateur de jeux indés.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E006A006F00750072002E0020004A00650020006D20190061007000700065006C006C006500200054007200690061006E002E000A004A00650020007300750069007300200063007200E9006100740065007500720020006400650020006A00650075007800200069006E006400E90073002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et je m’y connais aussi bien en polygones\nqu’en Porygon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500740020006A00650020006D2019007900200063006F006E006E0061006900730020006100750073007300690020006200690065006E00200065006E00200070006F006C00790067006F006E00650073000A0071007520190065006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E0020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et toi, tu t’y connais ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045007400200074006F0069002C002000740075002000742019007900200063006F006E006E0061006900730020003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En Porygon ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E0020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "En polygones ?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0045006E00200070006F006C00790067006F006E006500730020003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, en Porygon ! D’ailleurs, leur forme\nanguleuse te fait pas penser à autre chose ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oui, en polygones !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nCes formes géométriques qu’on utilise\nen infographie pour créer des objets 3D !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu joues aux jeux vidéo, non ?\nEh bien, les personnages que tu vois dedans...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1064,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "... ils sont constitués de polygones !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E00200069006C007300200073006F006E007400200063006F006E0073007400690074007500E9007300200064006500200070006F006C00790067006F006E006500730020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attends, je t’explique.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEn fait, on combine des formes géométriques\nsimples pour créer un objet tridimensionnel.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nÇa s’appelle la modélisation polygonale !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1316,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 165
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Plus on utilise de polygones, plus les courbes\ndes modèles sont lisses.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Avant, on avait des limites techniques, et\non pouvait pas utiliser beaucoup de polygones.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nC’est pour ça que les vieux modèles 3D ont l’air\nsi cubiques !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 160
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Porygon, lui, il aurait été créé avec la meilleure\ntechnologie de son époque.<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nMais bon, depuis, la technologie, elle a évolué !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 135
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bref, j’en viens à la raison pour laquelle\nje te raconte tout ça...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2392,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042007200650066002C0020006A20190065006E0020007600690065006E0073002000E00020006C006100200072006100690073006F006E00200070006F007500720020006C0061007100750065006C006C0065000A006A00650020007400650020007200610063006F006E0074006500200074006F00750074002000E70061002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’aimerais qu’on échange des Porygon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A201900610069006D006500720061006900730020007100752019006F006E002000E9006300680061006E00670065002000640065007300200050006F007200790067006F006E0020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu veux bien faire un échange de Porygon ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000760065007500780020006200690065006E00200066006100690072006500200075006E002000E9006300680061006E0067006500200064006500200050006F007200790067006F006E0020003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allons-y !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006C006F006E0073002D0079002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas maintenant.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006100730020006D00610069006E00740065006E0061006E0074002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pourtant, y a rien de plus excitant qu’un échange\nde Porygon ! Tu sais pas ce que tu rates !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Super ! Échangeons nos Porygon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2984,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0053007500700065007200200021002000C9006300680061006E00670065006F006E00730020006E006F007300200050006F007200790067006F006E0020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oooh, allez ! Échange un Porygon avec le mien !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006F006F0068002C00200061006C006C0065007A00200021002000C9006300680061006E0067006500200075006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E002000610076006500630020006C00650020006D00690065006E0020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un Porygon que je veux échanger !\nUn PO-RY-GON !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E00200071007500650020006A006500200076006500750078002000E9006300680061006E00670065007200200021000A0055006E00200050004F002D00520059002D0047004F004E0020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi ?\nPolissé évolue !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F00690020003F000A0050006F006C00690073007300E9002000E90076006F006C00750065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors ? T’as apprécié ma surprise ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F007200730020003F002000542019006100730020006100700070007200E90063006900E90020006D00610020007300750072007000720069007300650020003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Le Porygon que je t’ai donné tenait\nun Améliorator.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004C006500200050006F007200790067006F006E00200071007500650020006A00650020007420190061006900200064006F006E006E00E9002000740065006E006100690074000A0075006E00200041006D00E9006C0069006F007200610074006F0072002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et ça l’a fait évoluer en Porygon2 !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450074002000E700610020006C2019006100200066006100690074002000E90076006F006C00750065007200200065006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E00320020002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as vu ? Son corps est devenu tout lisse !\nC’est ÇA, le progrès de la technologie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette version améliorée contient une IA et\nun programme de développement planétaire.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il est pas encore entièrement autonome, mais\nje trouve que ça le rend encore plus attachant !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh ! Cette lueur...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002000210020004300650074007400650020006C0075006500750072002E002E002E00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’avais donné un Améliorator à ton Porygon,\ntoi aussi ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005420190061007600610069007300200064006F006E006E00E900200075006E00200041006D00E9006C0069006F007200610074006F0072002000E000200074006F006E00200050006F007200790067006F006E002C000A0074006F00690020006100750073007300690020003F002100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 61
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je suis pas le seul à faire des surprises !\nC’était vraiment un échange de Pokémon parfait !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je me demande si Porygon2 peut être amélioré,\nlui aussi... ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A00650020006D0065002000640065006D0061006E0064006500200073006900200050006F007200790067006F006E003200200070006500750074002000EA00740072006500200061006D00E9006C0069006F007200E9002C000A006C00750069002000610075007300730069002E002E002E0020003F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 65
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Poryry !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4676,
